note addname: packed name, register, type, length, kind, address. om4 ADDNAME. The table grows with the
note arena (group names); at twice as many names as buckets the buckets double (nm_build).
fn fe_addname w ulong r ulong t ulong ln ulong k ulong a ulong to void
n = get f_nn 0
fe_need 4 n
put ar_m add get ar_rb 4 n w
ar_pc 5 n uchar r
ar_pc 6 n uchar t
put ar_m add get ar_rb 7 n ln
ar_pc 8 n uchar k
