note ======== registers and words ========
note alloc: the next temporary after the parameters. From omc.om alloc (@943d9555 line 2975), which
note refused with error 12 once the 16-register pool was full: a code generator limit that ng does not
note have (D6), so the count goes on; slots past 16 share the last register number and keep no float flag.
fn fe_alloc to ulong
i = add get f_npar 0 get f_nslot 0
if lt i len f_vsl
put f_vsl i 0
end
put f_nslot 0 add get f_nslot 0 1
ret fe_poolc i
end

note destreg: d, or a new temporary when d is 255
