ret d
end


note trapsite: a run-time check site. From omc.om trapsite (@943d9555 line 2999), which also noted the
note branch's place and trap code for the stub (error 14 past 8192 sites, a code generator limit ng does
note not have, D6) and emitted it; the check pass keeps the om2 diag site record.
