note ---- R6 IR. A leading line `ir` writes OSC IR version 1. The AArch64 path is not taken.
note Worksheet ir_match.py matched omega_emit on the 10 dev programs; this is that algorithm.


note ir_lead: 1 when the first line is "ir" (after blanks). Both scans run as nested 999999-pass loops,
note so more than 1000000 leading blanks or first-line bytes are read, not trapped 4 (#671).
fn fe_ir_lead to ulong
p = ulong 0
go = true
while go
m = ulong 0
while and go lt m 999999
if ge p get f_inlen 0
go = false
else
